    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16100.png",
      "text": "Khale khale, Letsatsi, Khoeli, Pula le Moea li ne li loantšana.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:e6c1894070c15c2bd9268c6022a612c3b8d6d3649a854bb644b5ae9aa352a90d"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16101.png",
      "text": "Khang ea bona e ne e le hore Letsatsi le ne le batla ho chaba letšeare lohle. Khoeli e ne e batla ho khanya letsatsi kaofela. Pula e ne e batla ho na tsatsi le leng le le leng, le Moea o no batla ho foka nako eohle. Li ne li sa batle ho fana ka sebaka.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:7993ccdf8b2be66826fdea56d3f25bd9eff05484cc1761cf937c723a03ecba7c"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16102.png",
      "text": "Ba rera ho lula fatše, ba bue taba ena. Eaba kopanong ea bona, Letsatsi le botsa Khoeli, \"Ke eng eo u e etsang ho thusa lefatše?\" Khoeli ea araba ea re, \"Ke ea khantša bosiu hore liphoofolo li tsome.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:5981b0cd2b964baa572ee6b38359e3ad8b128ac124dc3f9f91cc5390aba34589"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16104.png",
      "text": "Khoeli ea botsa Pula, \"Ke eng eo u e etsang ho thusa lefatše?\" Pula ea araba, \"Ke fa lefatše metsi hore lifate le limela li hole hantle. Hape ke fa liphoofolo metsi hore li noe.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:5703784d470bd02631192f1affd81954f8bccfdd550fca6e62c651f6187e8f12"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16105.png",
      "text": "Pula ea botsa Moea, \"Ke'ng eo u e etsang ho thusa lefatše?\" Moea oa araba oa re, \"Ke fiela lefatše hore le hloeke. Ke hasa pula lefatše ka bophara ba lona.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:fb3672d1817125484888773000f0c7091b8313ede85dd54e5f3f98d21c775341"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16106.png",
      "text": "Moea le ona oa botsa Letsatsi, \"Ke'ng eo u e etsang ho thusa lefatše?\" Letsatsi la araba la re, \"Ke fa lefatše khanya le mofuthu, hore liphoofo le lihloliloeng li phele ha monate.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:8efeddb2de84b08e12385e728f7dd57b21fe8df55c70668ea2eaf4c3fdb1fff1"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16107.png",
      "text": "Letsatsi, Khoeli, Pula le Moea tsa mamelana ka hloko.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:79bbc9fa6495a6c749b7c49e3dc28efd1b8fd929c83d67966420c9f9c13d77b1"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16110.png",
      "text": "Eaba Letsatsi lere, \"'Nete ke hore e mong le e mong o thusa lefatše ka mokhoa o ikhethileng. 'Ee\", hoa bua Khoeli, \"Ha ho na ea molemo ho feta e mong hara rona.\" \"Re ka sebetsa 'moho.\" Hoa hlahisa Pula. Eaba Moea o re, \"Ha re arolelaneng matsatsi.\" Ba lumellana kaofela.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:a679590b2556059bd867af2986d82cd257bcea29145c6d4adeaf21f5b0ae9000"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/16108.png",
      "text": "Ke ka hona ka nako e 'ngoeu ka bonang Khoeli Letsatsi le ntse le chabile. U utloang Moea o foka Pula ha e ena. Letsatsi, Khoeli, Pula le Moea, li sebetsa hantle ha holo 'moho. Li na le kutloisisano.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:bc2cc91c6688deb23ed70436fba0ce4bdd9853453b5d89b9253fbfa2f6c08902"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": null,
      "text": "U rata letsatsi, khoeli, pula kapa moea? Taka eo u e ratang haholo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=2&dual=false&id=34939#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:95732f443e718b34f2b56c5ef1f0f3bdfd2d8667df165135f7689157f2de3af4"
    }
  ],
